WEBVTT

00:36:59.917 --> 00:37:02.292
that Auntie Anne's
did this for me for free.

00:37:02.917 --> 00:37:05.684
Employee: Well, as a son-in-law,
I appreciate the effort.

00:37:05.708 --> 00:37:06.976
I think it's a great idea.

00:37:07.000 --> 00:37:08.518
I can't give them for free.

00:37:08.542 --> 00:37:09.851
We do sell buckets,

00:37:09.875 --> 00:37:12.476
which probably may be
exactly what you're looking for.

00:37:12.500 --> 00:37:14.768
AG: OK, and so how
much does that normally cost?

00:37:14.792 --> 00:37:16.059
Employee: 24.99.

00:37:16.083 --> 00:37:18.101
AG: OK, so my goal is to get down to zero.

00:37:18.125 --> 00:37:21.351
Employee: How about this,
if you were to purchase a cup of nuggets,

00:37:21.375 --> 00:37:24.059
I can maybe get you a bunch of extra,
put it in a bucket

00:37:24.083 --> 00:37:26.684
so there's more than enough
to spell "happy birthday."

00:37:26.708 --> 00:37:30.518
AG: Did the father-in-law idea,
did that tug at your heartstrings at all?